<br clear="none" style="box-sizing:border-box" />
We would advise you to make contact with a customs licensed freight forwarding company to assist you further. We are unable to recommend a particular company but you will find many on any internet search engine.<br clear="none" style="box-sizing:border-box" />
&nbsp;<br clear="none" style="box-sizing:border-box" />
